========================================
1. Backward Incompatible Changes
========================================

- PDO:
  . PDOStatement::bindColumn() now throws a ValueError when the column name is
    not present in the result set. It previously reported the condition
    through PDO::ATTR_ERRMODE and returned false.

- Standard:
  . The number of filters that can be chained in a php://filter URL is limited
    to 16 by default. Set the stream context option max_filter_count to change
    this.

========================================
2. New Features
========================================

- Streams:
  . The so_linger, so_rcvbuf and so_sndbuf stream socket context options are
    now also applied to unix and unix datagram sockets.

