14. Performance Improvements
========================================

- Standard:
  . Improved performance of array_diff() for integer-only arrays with densely
    distributed values.
  . Improved performance of array_splice() when inserting without removing
    elements.
  . Improved performance of str_rot13().

- MBString:
  . Improved performance of mb_strlen for UTF-8 strings.
